            <h2 class="pipe mb-3 fs-2xl">
                Hardscape Contractor Serving Sudbury, Massachusetts
            </h2>

            <p>
                S. Phaneuf & Associates provides professional hardscape and outdoor construction services for residential and
                commercial properties throughout Sudbury, Massachusetts. We help property owners create attractive, functional
                outdoor spaces with carefully planned patios, walkways, retaining walls, steps, fire features, and other custom
                masonry and hardscape improvements.
            </p>

            <p>
                Every property has different requirements. Existing grades, drainage, access, soil conditions, landscaping, and
                the architectural style of the property all influence the right approach to a hardscape project. Our team combines
                experienced craftsmanship with careful preparation to create outdoor improvements designed for long-term use.
            </p>

            <p>
                Whether you are planning a new patio, improving an existing landscape, adding a retaining wall, or creating a
                more functional outdoor living area, we can help develop a solution that fits your property and your goals.
            </p>
        </section>

